# The fairy helper (#338, D82): a tiny maid with dragonfly wings and a skirt that glows like a firefly's lantern,
# one of the little lights the night did not put out. 16x16, front view. idle and fly frames are symmetric ('mirror');
# point frames hold the wand out to the right, and the -left copies are flipped in the grid (nothing is mirrored at
# runtime). appear1/appear2 are the one-time twinkle she arrives in after the forest-0 start tale.
# Ink k `020106` (#236): a shade deeper than the hero's `0b0814`, so the half of her contour that keeps its ink reads against
# her own glow over the near-black play band; the export lights her top edges in her lantern white `f2fff4`
# (forest_trap_sprites.RIM_STYLE).
# Order (FairyGuide): idle1-4, fly1-2, point1-3, point1-left..point3-left, appear1-2.
size 16 16
color k 020106
color h a0481c
color s f2c8a0
color e 2a1830
color d 2f9c90
color l 7fe0cc
color c f2fff4
color g c8ffe8
color w d0e4ff
color b 86b4e0
frame idle1 mirror
